  "historyNote": "#5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05 New. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2308.07) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300) New. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
